<title>USA: Milwaukee Metro Sewer District, Wis., repriced.</title>
<headline>Milwaukee Metro Sewer District, Wis., repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co., Inc. said Thursday it repriced Milwaukee Metropolitan Sewer District $196 million bond deal. The top yield at the repricing was 5.24 percent in 2017.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
